<h2>Étimologi</h2>
Étimologi.
Kecap &lt;a href="basa%20Hawaii"&gt;basa Hawaii&lt;/a&gt; Hawaiʻi diturunkeun ti &lt;a href="basa%20Proto-Polin%C3%A9sia"&gt;Proto-Polinésia&lt;/a&gt; *Sawaiki, kalawan &lt;a href="R%C3%A9konstruksi%20internal"&gt;rékonstruksi&lt;/a&gt; nu boga harti "lemah cai"; &lt;a href="Kognat"&gt;Kognat&lt;/a&gt; Hawaiʻi dipanggih di rupa-rupa basa Polinésia nu lian, kaasup &lt;a href="basa%20M%C4%81ori"&gt;Māori&lt;/a&gt; (Hawaiki), &lt;a href="basa%20Maori%20Kapuloan%20Cook"&gt;Rarotonga&lt;/a&gt; (ʻAvaiki), jeung &lt;a href="basa%20Samoa"&gt;Samoa&lt;/a&gt; (Savaiʻi).
Dumasar Pukui jeung Elbert, "Di tempat lian di Polinésia, Hawaiʻi atawa kognatna boga harti alam baka atawa bumi sepuh, tapi di Hawaiʻi, teu boga harti nanaon."
