Winnie the Pooh

Winnie the Pooh biasana disingget jadi Pooh Béar atawa Edward Béar nyaéta karakter fiksi baruang beunang &lt;a href="A.A%20Milne"&gt;A.A Milne&lt;/a&gt;. Buku munggaran ngeunaan baruang ieu medal dina taun &lt;a href="1926"&gt;1926&lt;/a&gt; kalawan judul &lt;a href="Winnie-the-Pooh"&gt;Winnie-the-Pooh&lt;/a&gt;. Tuluy buku kaduana dijudulan &lt;a href="The%20House%20at%20the%20Pooh%E2%80%99s%20Corner"&gt;The House at the Pooh’s Corner&lt;/a&gt; nu medal taun &lt;a href="1928"&gt;1928&lt;/a&gt;. 
Buku nu diilustrasi ku &lt;a href="E.H%20Shepard"&gt;E.H Shepard&lt;/a&gt; ieu tuluy diadaptasi ku &lt;a href="The%20Walt%20Disney%20Company"&gt;The Walt Disney Company&lt;/a&gt; jadi hiji pintonan serial &lt;a href="tipi"&gt;tipi&lt;/a&gt; jeung pilem. Di &lt;a href="Indonesia"&gt;Indonesia&lt;/a&gt; sorangan, serial Winnie the Pooh kungsi dipintonkeun dina salah sahiji stasion tipi swasta di &lt;a href="RCTI"&gt;RCTI&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Asal ngaran Winnie the Pooh</h2>
Asal ngaran Winnie the Pooh.
Ngaran Winnie asalna tina Winnipeg, &lt;a href="baruang"&gt;baruang&lt;/a&gt; hideung &lt;a href="Kanada"&gt;Kanada&lt;/a&gt; nu dipimilik ku salah sahiji tantara, &lt;a href="Letnan%20Harry%20Colebourne"&gt;Letnan Harry Colebourne&lt;/a&gt;. Nalika pasukan Colebourne rék perang di &lt;a href="Paris"&gt;Paris&lt;/a&gt;, Colebourne masrahkeun Winnie ka &lt;a href="London%20Zoo"&gt;London Zoo&lt;/a&gt;. Di ieu kebon binatang, Winnie panggih jeung Christhoper Robin. Saking ku nyaahna ka Winnie, Robin méré ngaran bonékana “Winnie”.
<h2>Pilem Winnie the Pooh</h2>
Pilem Winnie the Pooh.
Tanggal &lt;a href="4%20Pebruari"&gt;4 Pebruari&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1966"&gt;1966&lt;/a&gt;, pintonan animasi Winnie the Pooh produksi &lt;a href="Walt%20Disney"&gt;Walt Disney&lt;/a&gt; mimiti dipintonkeun. Dina animasi nu dijudulan &lt;a href="Winnie%20the%20pooh%20and%20the%20Honey%20Tree"&gt;Winnie the pooh and the Honey Tree&lt;/a&gt; ieu, nyaritakeun ngeunaan lalampahan Pooh nalika moro madu. Carita-caritana nu basajan kalawan karakter nu pikageugeuteun ngabalukarkeun Pooh dipikaresep ku barudak leutik. 
Tanggal &lt;a href="20%20Desember"&gt;20 Desember&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1968"&gt;1968&lt;/a&gt;, Walt Disney nyieun deui animasi Pooh kalawan judul &lt;a href="Winnie%20the%20Pooh%20and%20Blustery%20Day"&gt;Winnie the Pooh and Blustery Day&lt;/a&gt; nu dilélér &lt;a href="Academy%20Award"&gt;Academy Award&lt;/a&gt; tuluy dirilis jadi pilem &lt;a href="The%20Horse%20in%20the%20Gray%20Flanel%20Suit"&gt;The Horse in the Gray Flanel Suit&lt;/a&gt;. 
Salian ti éta, aya ogé pilem-pilem lianna kayaning &lt;a href="The%20Many%20Adventures%20of%20Winnie%20the%20Pooh"&gt;The Many Adventures of Winnie the Pooh&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="1977"&gt;1977&lt;/a&gt;), &lt;a href="The%20Tigger%20Movie"&gt;The Tigger Movie&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="2000"&gt;2000&lt;/a&gt;), &lt;a href="Piglet%E2%80%99s%20Big%20Movie"&gt;Piglet’s Big Movie&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="2003"&gt;2003&lt;/a&gt;), &lt;a href="Pooh%E2%80%99s%20Heffalump%20Movie"&gt;Pooh’s Heffalump Movie&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="2005"&gt;2005&lt;/a&gt;). Pilem nu panganyarna bakal dirilis ku The Walt Disney Company dina taun &lt;a href="2011"&gt;2011&lt;/a&gt; kalawan judul &lt;a href="Winnie%20the%20Pooh"&gt;Winnie the Pooh&lt;/a&gt;.
