<h2>Administrasi</h2>
Administrasi.
Antara 1946 jeung 2003, Polinésia Prancis miboga status wewengkon peuntas laut (basa Perancis: &lt;a href="territoire%20d%27outre-mer"&gt;territoire d'outre-mer&lt;/a&gt;, atawa TOM). Dina 2003, jadi hiji koléktivitas peuntas laut (basa Prancis: &lt;a href="collectivit%C3%A9%20d%27outre-mer"&gt;collectivité d'outre-mer&lt;/a&gt;, atawa COM). Dina undang-undang ti 27 Pébruari 2004 méré pangkat katangtu &lt;a href="Nagara%20peuntas%20laut%20Perancis"&gt;nagara peuntas laut dina républik&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="Basa%20Prancis"&gt;Basa Prancis&lt;/a&gt;:, atawa POM), tapi tampa parobihan légal dina statusna.
<h3>Babagian administratif</h3>
Babagian administratif.
Polinésia Perancis miboga lima subdivisi administratif (&lt;a href="Basa%20Prancis"&gt;Basa Prancis&lt;/a&gt;:):
<ul>
<li>&lt;a href="Kapuloan%20Marquesas"&gt;Kapuloan Marquesas&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="Basa%20Prancis"&gt;Basa Prancis&lt;/a&gt;: atawa resmina)</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Kapuloan%20Leeward%20%28Kapuloan%20Society%29"&gt;Kapuloan Leeward&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="Basa%20Prancis"&gt;Basa Prancis&lt;/a&gt;: atawa resmina) (dua &lt;a href="Kapuloan%20Windward%20%28Kapuloan%20Society%29"&gt;Kapuloan Windward&lt;/a&gt; jeung &lt;a href="Kapuloan%20Leeward%20%28Kapuloan%20Society%29"&gt;Kapuloan Leeward&lt;/a&gt; mangrupa bagian ti &lt;a href="Kapuloan%20Society"&gt;Kapuloan Society&lt;/a&gt;)</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Kapuloan%20Windward%20%28Kapuloan%20Society%29"&gt;Kapuloan Windward&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="Basa%20Prancis"&gt;Basa Prancis&lt;/a&gt;: atawa resmina) (dua &lt;a href="Kapuloan%20Windward%20%28Kapuloan%20Society%29"&gt;Kapuloan Windward&lt;/a&gt; jeung &lt;a href="Kapuloan%20Leeward%20%28Kapuloan%20Society%29"&gt;Kapuloan Leeward&lt;/a&gt; mangrupa bagian ti &lt;a href="Kapuloan%20Society"&gt;Kapuloan Society&lt;/a&gt;)</li>
<li>&lt;a href="%C3%8Eles%20Tuamotu-Gambier"&gt;Tuāmotu-Gambier&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="Basa%20Prancis"&gt;Basa Prancis&lt;/a&gt;: atawa resmina) (&lt;a href="Tuamotu"&gt;Tuamotu&lt;/a&gt; jeung &lt;a href="Kapuloan%20Gambier"&gt;Kapuloan Gambier&lt;/a&gt;)</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Kapuloan%20Austral"&gt;Kapuloan Austral&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="Basa%20Prancis"&gt;Basa Prancis&lt;/a&gt;: atawa resmina) (kaasup &lt;a href="Kapuloan%20Bass%20%28Polin%C3%A9sia%20Perancis%29"&gt;Kapuloan Bass&lt;/a&gt;)</li>
</ul>
<h2>Géografi</h2>
Géografi.
Pulo-pulo di Polinésia Perancis miboga total aréa daratan 4.167 kilométer pasagi (1.622 mil pasagi) kasebar dina wewengkon laut saluas 2.500.000 kilométer pasagi (965.255&amp;nbsp;mil&amp;nbsp;pasagi). Aya kira-kira 130 pulo di Polinésia Perancis. Titik nu pangluhurna &lt;a href="Gunung%20Orohena"&gt;Gunung Orohena&lt;/a&gt; di Tahiti.
Salian ti &lt;a href="Tahiti"&gt;Tahiti&lt;/a&gt;, sababraha &lt;a href="atol"&gt;atol&lt;/a&gt;, pulo, jeung grup kapuloan utama di Polinésia Perancis nu lian nyaéta: &lt;a href="Ahe"&gt;Ahē&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Bora%20Bora"&gt;Pora Pora&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Hiva%20Oa"&gt;Hiva 'Oa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Huahine"&gt;Huahine&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Maiao"&gt;Mai'ao&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Maupiti"&gt;Maupiti&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Mehetia"&gt;Meheti'a&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Moorea"&gt;Mo'orea&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Nuku%20Hiva"&gt;Nuku Hiva&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Raiatea"&gt;Ra'iātea&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Tahaa"&gt;Taha'a&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Tetiaroa"&gt;Te Ti'aroa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Tubuai%20%28Kapuloan%20Austral%29"&gt;Tupua'i&lt;/a&gt;, jeung &lt;a href="Tupai"&gt;Tūpai&lt;/a&gt;.
