<doc id="35467" url="https://su.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=35467" title="Brad Pitt">
Brad Pitt

Brad Pitt mangrupa salah sahiji aktor Hollywood anu kahot anu ngaran aslina William Bradley Pitt, mangrupa budak ti &lt;a href="William%20Alvin%20Pitt"&gt;William Alvin Pitt&lt;/a&gt; jeung &lt;a href="Jane%20Etta"&gt;Jane Etta&lt;/a&gt; di &lt;a href="Shawnee"&gt;Shawnee&lt;/a&gt; di &lt;a href="Oklahoma"&gt;Oklahoma&lt;/a&gt; ping &lt;a href="18%20Desember"&gt;18 Desember&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1963"&gt;1963&lt;/a&gt;.
Karir akting Pitt dimimitian nalika manéhna sakola akting bareng jeung &lt;a href="Roy%20London"&gt;Roy London&lt;/a&gt;, saurang palatih akting. Nalika dina karirna meunang kasempetan pikeun akting di hareupeun TV ngaliwatan serial sitkom Growing Pains &lt;a href="1987"&gt;1987&lt;/a&gt; dituluykeun kana opera sabun Dallas &lt;a href="1987"&gt;1987&lt;/a&gt;, ogé 21 Jump Street &lt;a href="1987"&gt;1987&lt;/a&gt;. Ari maén dina film nyaéta No Way Out, No Man's Land jeung Less Than Zero,sanajan acan ngirut panongton. Popularitas Pitt dimimitian tina aktingna minangka J.D dina serial &lt;a href="TV"&gt;TV&lt;/a&gt;, Thelma &amp; Louise taun &lt;a href="1991"&gt;1991&lt;/a&gt;, bareng jeung &lt;a href="Susan%20Sarandon"&gt;Susan Sarandon&lt;/a&gt; ogé &lt;a href="Geena%20Davis"&gt;Geena Davis&lt;/a&gt; anu dituluykeun kana Johnny Suede &lt;a href="1991"&gt;1991&lt;/a&gt;, A River Runs Throught It &lt;a href="1992"&gt;1992&lt;/a&gt;, Kalifornia &lt;a href="1993"&gt;1993&lt;/a&gt;, The Favor &lt;a href="1994"&gt;1994&lt;/a&gt;, Interview With The Vampire &lt;a href="1994"&gt;1994&lt;/a&gt; anu ngabalukarkeun Pitt meunangkeun penghargaan munggaranana jang katégori Best Performance Male jeung Most Desirable Male" dina acara &lt;a href="MTV%20Movie%20Awards"&gt;MTV Movie Awards&lt;/a&gt;.
Sabada éta ngaran Pitt di &lt;a href="Hollywood"&gt;Hollywood&lt;/a&gt; jadi leuwih moyan ogé meunangkeun deui sababaraha panglélér, kawas di Seven &lt;a href="1995"&gt;1995&lt;/a&gt; anu jang kaduakalina meunangkeun katégori Most Desirable Male dina &lt;a href="MTV%20Movie%20Awards"&gt;MTV Movie Awards&lt;/a&gt; jeung Twelve Monkeys &lt;a href="1995"&gt;1995&lt;/a&gt; anu bisa ngahontal &lt;a href="Best%20Supporting%20Actor"&gt;Best Supporting Actor&lt;/a&gt; dina &lt;a href="Golden%20Globe%20Award"&gt;Golden Globe Award&lt;/a&gt;. Satuluyna Pitt maén dina Meet Joe Black &lt;a href="1998"&gt;1998&lt;/a&gt;, Fight Club &lt;a href="1999"&gt;1999&lt;/a&gt;, The Mexican &lt;a href="2001"&gt;2001&lt;/a&gt;, Océan's Eleven &lt;a href="2001"&gt;2001&lt;/a&gt;, Spy Game &lt;a href="2001"&gt;2001&lt;/a&gt;, Troy &lt;a href="2004"&gt;2004&lt;/a&gt;, Océan's Twelve &lt;a href="2004"&gt;2004&lt;/a&gt;, Mr &amp; Mrs Smith &lt;a href="2005"&gt;2005&lt;/a&gt;, Babel &lt;a href="2006"&gt;2006&lt;/a&gt;, Océan's Thirteen &lt;a href="2007"&gt;2007&lt;/a&gt;, jeung Burn After réading &lt;a href="2008"&gt;2008&lt;/a&gt;.
Teu ngan saukur jadi aktor, Pitt mimiti kairut pikeun jadi &lt;a href="produser"&gt;produser&lt;/a&gt;. Troy &lt;a href="2004"&gt;2004&lt;/a&gt;, The Departed &lt;a href="2006"&gt;2006&lt;/a&gt;, Running With Scissors &lt;a href="2006"&gt;2006&lt;/a&gt;, A Mighty Héart &lt;a href="2007"&gt;2007&lt;/a&gt;, The Assassination Of Jesse James by The Coward Robert Ford &lt;a href="2007"&gt;2007&lt;/a&gt;, The Time Traveler's Wife &lt;a href="2009"&gt;2009&lt;/a&gt;, The Lost City of Z &lt;a href="2010"&gt;2010&lt;/a&gt; jeung éat, Pray, Love &lt;a href="2011"&gt;2011&lt;/a&gt; nyaéta film anu pernah di produseran ku Pitt. Film The Departed nepi ka meunang nominasi BAFTA award jang katégori Best Film jeung &lt;a href="film%20A%20Mighty%20Heart"&gt;film A Mighty Heart&lt;/a&gt; anu meunang nominasi dina &lt;a href="Independent%20Spirit%20Award"&gt;Independent Spirit Award&lt;/a&gt; minangka &lt;a href="Best%20Film"&gt;Best Film&lt;/a&gt;.
Ti taun &lt;a href="2005"&gt;2005&lt;/a&gt;, Pitt bobogohan jeung &lt;a href="Angelina%20Jolie"&gt;Angelina Jolie&lt;/a&gt;,Sabada ninggalkeun pamajikanana &lt;a href="Jennifer%20Aniston"&gt;Jennifer Aniston&lt;/a&gt; anu dikawin ping &lt;a href="29%20Juli"&gt;29 Juli&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2000"&gt;2000&lt;/a&gt;. 
Salila babarengan jeung Jolie, Pitt boga budak munggaranana nyaéta nalika ping &lt;a href="27%20Mei"&gt;27 Mei&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2006"&gt;2006&lt;/a&gt; anu dingaranan &lt;a href="Shiloh%20Nouval%20Jolie-Pitt"&gt;Shiloh Nouval Jolie-Pitt&lt;/a&gt;. Lian ti budak teges, aya sababaraha hiji budak adopsi Jolie-Pitt nyaéta &lt;a href="Maddox%20Chivan%20Jolie-Pitt"&gt;Maddox Chivan Jolie-Pitt&lt;/a&gt; anu diadopsi ping &lt;a href="19%20Januari"&gt;19 Januari&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2006"&gt;2006&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Pax%20Thien%20Jolie-Pitt"&gt;Pax Thien Jolie-Pitt&lt;/a&gt; anu diadopsi ping &lt;a href="15%20Maret"&gt;15 Maret&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2007"&gt;2007&lt;/a&gt; sarta &lt;a href="Zahara%20Marley%20Jolie-Pitt"&gt;Zahara Marley Jolie-Pitt&lt;/a&gt; anu diadopsi &lt;a href="19%20Januari"&gt;19 Januari&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2006"&gt;2006&lt;/a&gt;.
Nalika &lt;a href="12%20Juli"&gt;12 Juli&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2009"&gt;2009&lt;/a&gt;, Pitt jeung Jolie disinugrahan budak kembar anu dibabarkeun di &lt;a href="Nice"&gt;Nice&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Perancis"&gt;Perancis&lt;/a&gt;, jeung dibéré ngaran &lt;a href="Knox%20Leon%20Jolie-Pitt"&gt;Knox Leon Jolie-Pitt&lt;/a&gt; jeung &lt;a href="Vivienne%20Marcheline%20Jolie-Pitt"&gt;Vivienne Marcheline Jolie-Pitt&lt;/a&gt;.Hak cipta foto-foto munggaran orok kembarna dijual ka majalah &lt;a href="People"&gt;People&lt;/a&gt; jeung &lt;a href="Hello%21"&gt;Hello!&lt;/a&gt; anu hargana $14 juta (140 miliar Rupiah) anu jadi foto selebriti pangmahalna salila ieu.
Akting Pitt mimiti moyan deui sabada akting jadi &lt;a href="Benjamin%20Button"&gt;Benjamin Button&lt;/a&gt; dina film The Curious Case Of Benjamin Button. Ngaliwatan peranna ieu, Pitt dinominasikeun minangka aktor anu panghadéna di &lt;a href="Piala%20Oscar"&gt;Piala Oscar&lt;/a&gt;.
Popularitasna minangka aktor anu moyan di &lt;a href="Hollywood"&gt;Hollywood&lt;/a&gt;, ngabalukarkeun Pitt tungtungna dicalonkeun jadi walikota &lt;a href="New%20Orleans"&gt;New Orleans&lt;/a&gt;. Lian ti pamorna minangka sélébritis ogé rasa kamanusiaanana ka para korban badai katrina.
Dina acara &lt;a href="Screen%20Actor%20Guild%20Awards"&gt;Screen Actor Guild Awards&lt;/a&gt;, ngaliwatan film Inglourious Basterd &lt;a href="2009"&gt;2009&lt;/a&gt;, Pitt meunang panglélér &lt;a href="Outstanding%20Performance%20by%20a%20Cast%20in%20a%20Motion%20Picture"&gt;Outstanding Performance by a Cast in a Motion Picture&lt;/a&gt;.
