<doc id="35531" url="https://su.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=35531" title="Mick Jagger">
Mick Jagger

Sir Michael Philip 'Mick' Jagger atawa anu kasohor Mick Jagger nyaéta penyanyi rock, &lt;a href="aktor"&gt;aktor&lt;/a&gt;, penulis lagu, produsér pilem katut wirausahawan anu lahir tanggal &lt;a href="26%20Juli"&gt;26 Juli&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1943"&gt;1943&lt;/a&gt; di &lt;a href="Dartford"&gt;Dartford&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kent"&gt;Kent&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Inggris"&gt;Inggris&lt;/a&gt;, Mick ogé kasohor salaku pentolan grup musik &lt;a href="rock"&gt;rock&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="The%20Rolling%20Stones"&gt;The Rolling Stones&lt;/a&gt;.
Jagger disebut sosok lalaki anu romantis, manéhna kungsi boga hubungan husus jeung para sélébritis, saperti &lt;a href="Chrissie%20Shrimpton"&gt;Chrissie Shrimpton&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Marianne%20Faithfull"&gt;Marianne Faithfull&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Anita%20Pallenberg"&gt;Anita Pallenberg&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Marsha%20Hunt"&gt;Marsha Hunt&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Pamela%20Des%20Barres"&gt;Pamela Des Barres&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Uschi%20Obermaier"&gt;Uschi Obermaier&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Bebe%20Buell"&gt;Bebe Buell&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Carly%20Simon"&gt;Carly Simon&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Margaret%20Trudeau"&gt;Margaret Trudeau&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Mackenzie%20Phillips"&gt;Mackenzie Phillips&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Janice%20Dickinson"&gt;Janice Dickinson&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Carla%20Bruni"&gt;Carla Bruni&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Sophie%20Dahl"&gt;Sophie Dahl&lt;/a&gt; jeung &lt;a href="Angelina%20Jolie"&gt;Angelina Jolie&lt;/a&gt;. Jagger kungsi nikah 2 kali, nu pertama jeung &lt;a href="Bianca%20De%20Macias"&gt;Bianca De Macias&lt;/a&gt;, nu kadua jeung &lt;a href="Jerry%20Hall"&gt;Jerry Hall&lt;/a&gt;.
Dina karir solona, Jagger ngarilis She's the Boss' (&lt;a href="25%20P%C3%A9bruar"&gt;25 Pébruar&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1985"&gt;1985&lt;/a&gt;), Primitive Cool (&lt;a href="14%20S%C3%A9pt%C3%A9mber"&gt;14 Séptémber&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1987"&gt;1987&lt;/a&gt;), Wandering Spirit (&lt;a href="8%20P%C3%A9bruari"&gt;8 Pébruari&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1993"&gt;1993&lt;/a&gt;) jeung Goddess in the Doorway (&lt;a href="19%20Nop%C3%A9mber"&gt;19 Nopémber&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2001"&gt;2001&lt;/a&gt;). Sedengkeun dina widang seni peran, Jagger kungsi jadi aktor dna sababaraha pilem, diantarana: PERFORMANCE (&lt;a href="1968"&gt;1968&lt;/a&gt;), NED KELLY (&lt;a href="1970"&gt;1970&lt;/a&gt;), WINGS OF ASH (&lt;a href="1978"&gt;1978&lt;/a&gt;), RUNNING OUT OF LUCK (&lt;a href="1987"&gt;1987&lt;/a&gt;), FREEJACK (&lt;a href="1992"&gt;1992&lt;/a&gt;), BENT (&lt;a href="1997"&gt;1997&lt;/a&gt;), THE MAN FROM ELYSIAN FIELDS (&lt;a href="2001"&gt;2001&lt;/a&gt;) jeung MAYOR OF THE SUNSET STRIP" (&lt;a href="2003"&gt;2003&lt;/a&gt;).
